{
  "part": 1,
  "title": "The Night the Sea Stood Up",
  "lines": [
    {"id": "P1-L01", "text": "Every night at four,", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P1-L02", "text": "Ravi opened the bakery.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P1-L03", "text": "Same ovens. Same quiet street.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P1-L04", "text": "Tonight, even the dogs were silent.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1},
    {"id": "P1-L05", "text": "Then the windows hummed...", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P1-L06", "text": "The floor rolled under him.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P1-L07", "text": "Every light went dark.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1.2},
    {"id": "P1-L08", "text": "The street split open...", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P1-L09", "text": "Walls folded like paper.", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P1-L10", "text": "He didn't stop running.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P1-L11", "text": "Then the sirens started.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.8},
    {"id": "P1-L12", "text": "He turned toward the sea.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P1-L13", "text": "The sea was standing up.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1},
    {"id": "P1-L14", "text": "The radio tower. Uphill.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.8},
    {"id": "P1-L15", "text": "Eight seconds. Maybe less.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.4},
    {"id": "P1-L16", "text": "Climb. Don't look down.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.8},
    {"id": "P1-L17", "text": "The wave hit the hill...", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1.8},
    {"id": "P1-L18", "text": "When the water went still,", "speaker": "narrator"},
    {"id": "P1-L19", "text": "Ravi was still holding on.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 0.6},
    {"id": "P1-L20", "text": "The city was gone.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1.2},
    {"id": "P1-L21", "text": "Then, far away, a light blinked.", "speaker": "narrator", "pauseAfter": 1},
    {"id": "P1-L22", "text": "Someone else was alive.", "speaker": "narrator"}
  ],
